   676 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   677 				; Read_Image_Palette - read just the .PAL block (the first one) of File_Index's
   678 				; .V1K into $21000.  Does NOT touch the palette registers - the caller applies
   679 				; it (Apply_Image_Palette) once the screen it belongs to is ready.  File_Index
   680 				; must be set before calling.  Used by Selector_Handle_P (P-preview, ui.asm).
   681 				;  Out: C=1 if the file is missing or short.
   682 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
