  1042 				; Same column order: TL/TR pal ids (<<4), left edge then right edge. Right
  1043 				; edge is horizontally mirrored (pal 1,0 instead of 0,1) so the right-hand
  1044 				; copy reads as a flipped reflection of the left-hand one; the underlying
  1045 				; pixel data (Menu_Demo_Dest_Table) is untouched, only which palette
  1046 				; register each cell points at changes.
  1047 3718			Menu_Demo_Attr_Top_Vals
  1048 3718 00 00 10 10 10 10 + 	dta $00,$00,$10,$10,$10,$10,$00,$00
  1049 				; Same column order: BL/BR pal ids (<<4), left edge then right edge (mirrored:
