  1201 				; this is its only user.  The 12 BCBs already in bcbs.asm exactly fill the
  1202 				; $100-$1FF VBXE VRAM budget (see the memory-map comment at the top of this
  1203 				; file); a 13th BCB overflowed BLT_NFO_NAME_CLEAR across the $200 boundary
  1204 				; into the NTSC_Palette load and corrupted it - do not add a new BCB here.
