   942 				; one) - always 10 chars at UI_COUNT_COL, numbers space-padded to 3.  NNN =
   943 				; ImageCount - FileStart (the *.V1K group only).  Builds it in Txt_Line.
   944 				; Clobbers A/X/Y, Reg1, Reg2, Reg7, Txt_Ptr.
